[2026-11-16T10:21:47.379Z] [fix_defect-df-636577] final_answer: Confirmed DEFECT-0002 no longer reproduces. The fix is present: xcoder-dojo/src/backend/markdown.ts has an allowlist-based isSafeHref() permitting only http, https, mailto, or scheme-less (relative/fragment) destinations; every other scheme (javascript:, data:, vbscript:, file:, any casing) is emitted as an inert text span, so the link label survives but no executable href reaches the renderer. MarkdownView only ever receives href values from that allowlist. Regression coverage exists at both layers: src/backend/__tests__/markdown.test.ts (link scheme policy) and src/ui/__tests__/render.test.ts (MarkdownView neutralises a javascript: link). I ran the exact reproduction command from .xcoder/defects/defect0002.md as the targeted re-run, then the project's whole suite; both pass. No lasting source changes were made — scratch reproducer files were deleted and the test file is unchanged at its original 150 lines.
